<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Website terms</p><h1 class="t1 rise">Using the company website.</h1><p class="lede fade">These terms describe this informational website and its inquiry flow.</p><p class="doc-meta">Last updated November 2, 2026</p></div></section><section class="doc"><div class="wrap doc-grid"><div class="doc-aside"><details class="doc-toc" open><summary class="doc-aside-t">On this page</summary><nav aria-label="Page contents"><a href="#section-0">Operator and contact</a><a href="#section-1">Information and inquiries</a><a href="#section-2">Use the website lawfully</a><a href="#section-3">Product availability</a><a href="#section-4">Materials and project rights</a><a href="#section-5">Separate agreements</a><a href="#section-6">Changes</a></nav></details><p class="doc-aside-t">More</p><nav aria-label="Legal"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/legal{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-legal{% endif %}">All legal information</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a></nav></div><div class="doc-body"><section id="section-0"><i>01</i><h2>Operator and contact</h2><p>This website is operated by VELANI LLC. Velani is a brand of VELANI LLC. Contact <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> or write to 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p></section><section id="section-1"><i>02</i><h2>Information and inquiries</h2><p>The website describes software products and custom development. Sending an inquiry does not begin a paid engagement, reserve availability, create a software account or make a purchase.</p></section><section id="section-2"><i>03</i><h2>Use the website lawfully</h2><p>Do not attempt unauthorized access, disrupt the website, submit malicious material or misuse another person’s information. Do not send credentials or sensitive personal records through the public inquiry form.</p></section><section id="section-3"><i>04</i><h2>Product availability</h2><p>Each product page states its current status. NEVORA is available to businesses by quote. A product page is not a promise of a price, a release date for a feature or a completed capability.</p></section><section id="section-4"><i>05</i><h2>Materials and project rights</h2><p>VELANI LLC and its clients each own their own materials, and product names and designs stay with their owners. This website grants no software license or assignment of intellectual property. Who owns deliverables, pre-existing materials and third-party licenses belongs in a client’s written agreement.</p></section><section id="section-5"><i>06</i><h2>Separate agreements</h2><p>Paid software access and custom projects have their own written terms. Those terms, not this website, set any liability, refund or intellectual-property commitments. An inquiry does not waive rights you have under the law.</p></section><section id="section-6"><i>07</i><h2>Changes</h2><p>When we change these terms, we update the date at the top of the page. Before you accept a paid offer, we give you its commercial terms.</p></section><div class="doc-end"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>, or to VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact{% endif %}">Contact</a></div></div></div></div></section>
